.TH "TODOPRO RESCHEDULE" "1" "2026-10-13" "1.0.0" "todopro reschedule Manual"
.SH NAME
todopro\-reschedule \- Reschedule a task or all overdue tasks to...
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B todopro reschedule
[OPTIONS] [TASK_ID]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reschedule a task or all overdue tasks to today.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-d,\fP \-\-date TEXT
New due date (YYYY-MM-DD, or e.g. today, tomorrow, next monday)
.TP
\fB\-y,\fP \-\-yes
Skip confirmation
